@startuml
actor "Clinic Staff" as Staff
participant "Appointment UI" as UI
participant AppointmentServlet
participant AppointmentService as Service
participant CatalogDao
participant AppointmentDao
database PostgreSQL
Staff -> UI: Submit patient and booking details
UI -> AppointmentServlet: POST /api/appointments
AppointmentServlet -> Service: create(request)
Service -> Service: validate patient, contact, date, time
Service -> CatalogDao: find dentist and treatment
CatalogDao -> PostgreSQL: SELECT active catalog records
PostgreSQL --> CatalogDao: Dentist and treatment
Service -> AppointmentDao: hasActiveSlot(dentist, date, time)
AppointmentDao -> PostgreSQL: SELECT active slot
alt slot already occupied
  PostgreSQL --> AppointmentDao: Match
  AppointmentDao --> Service: true
  Service --> AppointmentServlet: ConflictException
  AppointmentServlet --> UI: 409 conflict message
else slot available
  PostgreSQL --> AppointmentDao: Empty
  AppointmentDao --> Service: false
  Service -> AppointmentDao: save(appointment)
  AppointmentDao -> PostgreSQL: INSERT patient and appointment
  PostgreSQL --> AppointmentDao: Generated IDs
  AppointmentDao --> Service: Appointment
  Service --> AppointmentServlet: Appointment
  AppointmentServlet --> UI: 201 appointment details
end
@enduml
